  "question": "Where is the nearest restaurant encountered en route to Fred Crabtree Park, Herndon, VA from Rock of the Marne, VA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.073797 38.876769)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.359991 38.913126)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.073797 38.876769)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.073797 38.876769)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
